## What it is

An open-world Western adventure following Arthur Morgan and the Van der Linde gang.

## Is this your kind of game?

This is a choice for readers interested in a character-led Western and an open world to explore. Look at the pacing of travel and ordinary activities as well as action scenes when deciding whether it fits your interests.

## Download and purchase

This is a paid game. Check the official store for current regional pricing, editions, and purchase terms. Use the official Steam button on this page to open the publisher's listing. Installation is handled by Steam; GameNews does not host installers or game files.

Confirm the exact product title and edition on the store. Review its current account, launcher, and hardware requirements before purchasing or installing.

## What the Steam listing shows

Checked 23 November 2026. Steam lists Rockstar Games as both developer and publisher, with a Steam release date of 5 December 2019. The listing covers single-player plus online PvP and online co-op. Steam lists partial controller support and in-app purchases.

The minimum column asks for 64-bit Windows 10, an Intel Core i5-2500K or AMD FX-6300, 8 GB of memory, an Nvidia GeForce GTX 770 2GB or AMD Radeon R9 280 3GB, a broadband connection, 150 GB of storage, and a DirectX-compatible sound card. Steam says a Rockstar Games account is required, and that it can be linked to Steam.

## Sources and editorial basis

Product information checked against the [official Steam listing](https://store.steampowered.com/app/1174180/?l=english) on 16 October 2026 and rechecked on 23 November 2026. Selected with reference to [Steam's most-played chart](https://store.steampowered.com/charts/mostplayed/). This is a researched profile, not a hands-on review or a search-volume ranking. Live prices, player counts, and performance scores are intentionally not quoted.
